     "t": "The ten things that can be marketed",
     "src": "L#3",
     "h": "\n  <div class=\"scroller\"><table><thead><tr><th>Entity</th><th>His example</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n   <tr><td><strong>Goods</strong></td><td>Apple Watch</td></tr>\n   <tr><td><strong>Services</strong></td><td>Salons — BBlunt, Toni &amp; Guy, local; each a different value proposition</td></tr>\n   <tr><td><strong>Experiences</strong></td><td><strong>Imagica</strong> sells happiness and memories, not rides · Sunburn · Coca-Cola's <strong>&ldquo;Make a Friend&rdquo;</strong> vending machines across the India–Pakistan border</td></tr>\n   <tr><td><strong>Financial services</strong></td><td><strong>American Express</strong> — markets the experience, &ldquo;the gateway to great experiences&rdquo;, not the card</td></tr>\n   <tr><td><strong>Persons</strong></td><td>Dwayne Johnson (Papatui) · Oprah · Hrithik Roshan (<strong>HRX</strong>) · Virat Kohli · Kriti Sanon (Hyphen)</td></tr>\n   <tr><td><strong>Places</strong></td><td><strong>Rajasthan Tourism</strong> — &ldquo;Agar Neha ne Rajasthan dekha…&rdquo;</td></tr>\n   <tr><td><strong>Properties</strong></td><td>World Towers Mumbai · Trump Towers Delhi · <strong>The Camellias</strong>, Gurgaon at ₹85–100 crore</td></tr>\n   <tr><td><strong>Organizations</strong></td><td>Harvard Business School — faculty, students, legacy</td></tr>\n   <tr><td><strong>Information</strong></td><td><strong>NIRF rankings</strong> · AACSB accreditation</td></tr>\n   <tr><td><strong>Ideas</strong></td><td>Zomato's &ldquo;Hungry&rdquo; New Year campaign · Blinkit's two-minute promise</td></tr>\n  </tbody></table></div>\n  <div class=\"def\">The marketing system has two halves — <b>industry (the sellers)</b> and <b>market (the buyers)</b> — joined by <b>four flows</b>: communication and goods/services going out, <b>money and information</b> coming back.</div><!--viz:pom-marketing-system--><figure style=\"margin:16px 0;padding:14px 12px 12px;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:4px;background:var(--surface)\" aria-label=\"Two boxes, industry (sellers) and market (buyers), joined by four flows: communication and goods or services from industry to market, money and information from market to industry.\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--ink)\">The simple marketing system</div><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 440 214\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Industry (sellers) on the left and market (buyers) on the right, joined by four arrows: communication and goods or services go to the market; money and information come back to the industry.\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;min-width:280px;max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;font-family:var(--body)\">\n<rect x=\"16\" y=\"30\" width=\"120\" height=\"170\" rx=\"4\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--rule-2);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<rect x=\"304\" y=\"30\" width=\"120\" height=\"170\" rx=\"4\" style=\"fill:var(--blue-soft);stroke:var(--blue);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<text x=\"76\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:700\">Industry</text>\n<text x=\"76\" y=\"129\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--ink-2);font-size:13px\">(sellers)</text>\n<text x=\"364\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:700\">Market</text>\n<text x=\"364\" y=\"129\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--ink-2);font-size:13px\">(buyers)</text>\n<path d=\"M142,62 L298,62\" fill=\"none\" style=\"stroke:var(--ink-3);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M288,58 L298,62 L288,66 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--ink-3)\"/>\n<text x=\"220\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--ink-2);font-size:13px\">Communication</text>\n<path d=\"M142,102 L298,102\" fill=\"none\" style=\"stroke:var(--ink-3);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M288,98 L298,102 L288,106 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--ink-3)\"/>\n<text x=\"220\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--ink-2);font-size:13px\">Goods / services</text>\n<path d=\"M142,142 L298,142\" fill=\"none\" style=\"stroke:var(--clay);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M152,138 L142,142 L152,146 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--clay)\"/>\n<text x=\"220\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--clay);font-size:13px\">Money</text>\n<path d=\"M142,182 L298,182\" fill=\"none\" style=\"stroke:var(--clay);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M152,178 L142,182 L152,186 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--clay)\"/>\n<text x=\"220\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--clay);font-size:13px\">Information</text>\n</svg></div><figcaption style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink-3)\">Two flows go out, two come back: information returning is as important as money.</figcaption></figure><!--/viz:pom-marketing-system-->"
